#: ../../../introduction/getting-started.rst:6 f6e058f39b3349d982f749ebf1af0963
msgid ""
"After `downloading <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ "
"and :doc:`installing </user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-"
